      "summary": "Evidence summary: 5 validated structured observations; consult observations and conflicts for supported findings.",
      "observations": [
        {
          "category": "mechanics",
          "statement": "Player discussion describes the sequel as retaining the accessible 3D arena-fighter foundation while expanding the roster and quality-of-life features; the larger character set and distinct Quirk-driven matchups are a recurring reason players prefer it to the first game.",
          "sentiment": "positive",
          "recurrence": "limited",
          "mention_count": 2,
